        "name": "black-2-white-2",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/14/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "つきのような　かがやきを　はなつ\nはね。　あくむを　ふりはらう　ちからを\nひめていると　つたえられている。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "달처럼 반짝임을 발산하는 날개.\n악몽을 뿌리치는 힘을\n간직하고 있다고 전해진다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Une plume qui brille comme la lune.\nOn dit qu’elle a le pouvoir de chasser les\ncauchemars.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Diese Feder leuchtet wie der Mond.\nKann angeblich Alpträume vertreiben.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Tarjeta para conseguir puntos con el programa de\nradio Las contraseñas de Buena.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Piuma che brilla come la luna. Pare che abbia\nil potere di allontanare gli incubi.",
